    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d31d1e02f49a23610a009fca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个～明天的话……\r\n会是这个……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7006988c5ed9c4d8b0ce240433f1a1a90f81698dce3151ad8a771736058ae3a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:338b9d505fcf4ca40b91f3d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "头晕目眩的……奇怪？\r\n训练员变成了三个、五个……\r\n变得越来越多个了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b03e65a3c1e3477bd2a800b77e5444351e117c8be48ef4b806a06af9fdf6f2a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5417d811be61b7aaeb9fbb78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔唔……我想要休息一下下……\r\n我是个体力很差的赛马娘，\r\n真的很对不起……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "422db3f86fb1f07e26d5e2aea02f3f7bd45ea0f12aecb97059468110e72780c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:661837e491acaa8188160bce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的我跟平常很不一样哦～\r\n因为我成功完全不吃螺丝地\r\n完成了好歌剧的模仿……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c59e51e2e2d8a5d1a1f994cccd85bac43681b1bfdb984f6e05ff43647bdec850",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a62463f810aeb436ec1134a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在的我好像什么都做得到……\r\n啊！我不小心太过自信了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4235de294259f1d27cdb3d6972cf54e14c7c29d983cb6dafd43cdd43fdd4aa90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3be1d4dc97819dc67e452abb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我觉得自己今天的状态好像不错……\r\n所以想要尝试很多东西……\r\n可、可以吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b15ee1d3279cb2066681eba34c82e1b4280b1356ec77637eafaff84145269f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80de84179a62f3fc3b35fee2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态好的时候是很珍贵的……\r\n我想要做一些\r\n趁现在才能做到的训练……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d49b2eb4915a64a3a0a00f9adf8d070c1c57484db7f8b955f48f47a61f406c2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3d63dee218bb3e3a2092b8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个……要不要去角落一点的地方？\r\n我这种人还占用大空间训练，\r\n感觉很不好意思。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1fe328f189e58be1f0c030c6fa1fac8f2855fb49b8809abe723e39a0d334945",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d774279b3bf2d57462a932eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从做得到的事情开始做起的话，\r\n像我这样的……是不是也会成长呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f6a2667101c098adba11a42c73a55103b345d5a10410a635759baa54014595a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9b2a748f112b232318900b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉大家比平常还要更耀眼……\r\n我真的有办法追上大家吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5df49ef19c576d0fb89bf18894dd24610565f9a11b6cbadc01fc8cbb57f4b0e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ecfbcd95428dd32da48c58e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的没有被我拖累吗……？\r\n我老是给人惹麻烦……呜呜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da732ead2903a84415423dd163b76cf67a9c1cefbe587317a66d60ad847ba490",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e42bd1ef04ae2df57d6419f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我老是这么冒失，真的很对不起……\r\n对不起，我不该出生的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f3f94c958095cab4940770cccd2fbbaf1a914cb774c1992ab9a1158ff19f697",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92c3cf95856f672c367090f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜呜呜……\r\n我果然是个没用又没救的\r\n慢吞吞赛马娘，呜呜……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8889ebd8b4c284acbcb6b0b622784c885e7a66c9382b545b8d485d71a39adec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21eeb9d2e94ffeb87c1c1d66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……请问我们是要报名参赛吗？\r\n……果然是要参赛的吧。\r\n没用的人就该做更多的努力才行……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6af9709c45dbba8c8aa2f6b1892ba2d53da993dd54a92fca64ebd845ee9c7e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:91a3363b24aebc17817b8694",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对不起、对不起……！\r\n我要跑起来……要参赛才行……\r\n可是身体却动不了了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b48a4149c9f04e18a48eb18b8f812595ada7731f6171d867c5452999cd295e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:448cffec033f1d97d9477d1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态非常好……！\r\n应、应该吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "00b220e467fc72c52158f5ac26420454da0c99ff43c54e37ae7afbf71caecba3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d20923220e4f8550225e3f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈、哈──哈哈哈哈！\r\n……我、我今天的干劲，\r\n就像好歌剧一样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffc2ba8bf4c6043f48997fa2bc65351a65c9f053f1d034aa056fc2615a54d079",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e2e34b7b692357f6b249251",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "该准备的事情都有做好了……\r\n感觉会有比平常更好的成绩……\r\n应该可以……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48ebd542711c0d8c4871d182eac3c5b1c69bb5a60559a16e9ada1444bbb326d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1058",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42726321191ee409e11f2998",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然也有可能是我想太多了，\r\n但我觉得自己的状态好像还可以。\r\n……虽然只是稍微有这种感觉～",
